{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cbs","name":"Biblica® 圣经当代译本开放资源","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbs","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbs","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CBS","englishName":"Mandarin Chinese Open Contemporary Bible (Simplified)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"74bf453a33641322ae4ddd23e051ee64d1412722972e541371ef97308285fe7d","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":30961,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"ECC","translationId":"cmn_cbs","name":"传道书","commonName":"传道书","title":"传道书","order":21,"numberOfChapters":12,"sha256":"3f5b39eb02d7a1d6766cabadd5a21eb777a96ecc4aafa2082814665aaa8ba329","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/ECC/1.json","lastChapterNumber":12,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/ECC/12.json","totalNumberOfVerses":221},"chapter":{"number":11,"content":[{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":[{"text":"当把你的粮食运到海外，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因为日久必有收获。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"当把你的投资分成七份，甚至八份，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因为你不知道日后会有什么灾难临到世上。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"云中满了水，就会下雨。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"树不论倒向南或倒向北，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"倒在哪里就躺在哪里。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你若总指望风轻云淡的日子，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"必无法撒种，无法收割。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":["正如你不知道风的路线，不知道骨骼在母胎中如何形成，你也无法了解创造万物之上帝的作为。"]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":["你早晚都要撒种，因为你不知道什么时候撒的会茁壮生长，或许早晚撒的长的一样好。"]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":["光真美好，能够看见阳光真好！"]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":["人一生不论活多久，都要活得快乐，但不要忘记死后有许多黑暗的日子。将来的一切都是虚空。"]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":["年轻人啊，在年轻时要快乐，要在青春岁月里使自己的心欢畅。心里想做什么就去做，眼睛想看什么就去看。然而，要切记：上帝必照你所行的一切审判你。"]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":["所以，你要抛开心中的烦恼和肉体的痛苦，因为青春年华转瞬即逝。"]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/ECC/11.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/ECC/12.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/ECC/10.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":10}